# HorizonCode overlay model.
# opencode/ is the tracked pinned upstream snapshot. The root workspace is hydrated
# from it; byte-identical root copies stay ignored to avoid duplicate commits.
# Every HorizonCode delta MUST be explicitly Git-visible and is enforced by
# scripts/architecture/audit_overlay_visibility.py.
